        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jennifer Weiner, Curtis Hanson, Cameron Diaz, Toni Collette, Shirley MacLaine\n- Works: In Her Shoes, In Her Shoes (film), Good in Bed\n- Topics: novel-to-film adaptation, film directing\n\nFacts:\n- Jennifer Weiner wrote Good in Bed as her debut novel.\n- Jennifer Weiner published the novel In Her Shoes in 2002.\n- In Her Shoes was adapted into a 2005 American comedy-drama film based on Jennifer Weiner's novel of the same name.\n- Curtis Hanson directed In Her Shoes in 2005.\n- The 2005 film In Her Shoes starred Cameron Diaz, Toni Collette, and Shirley MacLaine.",
